flowchart TB
    S1["1 · DISCOVER ARCHITECTURAL DRIVERS<br/>Stakeholders name the functions,<br/>constraints and quality attributes"]
    S2["2 · ESTABLISH PROJECT SCOPE<br/>Drivers specification · statement of work<br/>Master design plan — no build schedule yet"]
    S3["3 · CREATE / REFINE ARCHITECTURE<br/>A notional architecture, made quickly<br/>— then refined on every later pass"]
    S4["4 · ARCHITECTURE REVIEW<br/>Evaluate the design and document<br/>the issues it carries"]
    G{"5 · PRODUCTION<br/>GO / NO-GO?"}
    S6["6 · EXPERIMENTATION<br/>Targeted prototypes, one per open issue<br/>— then back to stage 3"]
    S7["7 · PRODUCTION PLANNING<br/>Estimate and schedule from the<br/>architecture's own elements"]
    S8["8 · PRODUCTION<br/>Build, integrate and test<br/>— whole system or increments"]
    S1 --> S2
    S2 --> S3
    S3 --> S4
    S4 --> G
    G -->|"NO-GO"| S6
    S6 -.->|"refine"| S3
    G -->|"GO"| S7
    S7 --> S8
    style S1 fill:#f0f8f0,stroke:#019546,color:#282828
    style S2 fill:#f0f8f0,stroke:#019546,color:#282828
    style S3 fill:#f0f8f0,stroke:#019546,color:#282828
    style S4 fill:#f0f8f0,stroke:#019546,color:#282828
    style G fill:#019546,stroke:#2D6E2A,color:#ffffff
    style S6 fill:#fdf6e3,stroke:#2D6E2A,color:#282828
    style S7 fill:#f0f8f0,stroke:#019546,color:#282828
    style S8 fill:#f0f8f0,stroke:#019546,color:#282828

